Subject: [PATCH] Accept complete framed V2 blocks with authenticated costs and
 contextual headers

Review correction: Accept complete framed V2 blocks with authenticated costs and contextual headers.

This isolated V2 candidate change preserves the existing Bitcoin parser and
mainnet parameters. Module tests do not establish lotusd block acceptance.
